msgstr "Dejjem jintlaħaq, anke bla SIM"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:844
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. Bluetooth and USB levels apply "
"when those call routes are active."
msgstr "Dan huwa l-volum tas-sejħa għal kull ħruġ. Il-livell japplika waħdu meta sejħa tingħaqad u kull darba li l-ħruġ jinbidel waqt sejħa, u l-bidliet fuq l-iżlajder jinstemgħu minnufih. Il-ħardwer japplika l-livelli bi passi kbar, u l-isperker tal-widna qatt ma jisket għalkollox. Il-livelli tal-Bluetooth u tal-USB japplikaw meta dawk il-mogħdijiet tas-sejħiet ikunu attivi."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:847
msgid ""
"When enabled, the network is asked to confirm when your text and multimedia "
"messages reach the recipient's phone.\n"
"\n"
"A confirmation is reliable when it arrives, but many carriers and automated "
"senders never produce one, so a message without a confirmation may still "
"have been delivered. Delivered never means read."
msgstr "Meta mixgħul, in-netwerk jintalab jikkonferma meta l-messaġġi tat-test u tal-multimidja tiegħek jaslu fit-telefon ta' min jirċievihom.\n\nKonferma hija affidabbli meta tasal, imma ħafna operaturi u mittenti awtomatiċi qatt ma jagħmlu waħda, għalhekk messaġġ bla konferma xorta jista' jkun wasal. „Twassal“ qatt ma jfisser „nqara“."

